# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_17593> (maltooligosaccharide)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_17593> "A glucooligosaccharide derived from glucose monomers linked via α-<small>D</small>-1,4 bonds as in maltose.  The term is commonly applied to the series of linear oligosaccharides composed of two, three, four, five and six such units of glucose.")
