AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_26986> "An α-amino acid in which one of the hydrogens attached to the α-carbon of glycine is substituted by a 1-hydroxyethyl group.")
