# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_32159> (sucralose)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_32159> "A disaccharide derivative consisting of 4-chloro-4-deoxy-α-<small>D</small>-galactopyranose and 1,6-dichloro-1,6-dideoxy-β-<small>D</small>-fructofuranose units linked by a glycosidic bond.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_32159> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B4430>)
