AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_42491> "The simplest member of the class of flavones that consists of 4H-chromen-4-one bearing a phenyl substituent at position 2.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_42491> "flavone")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_42491> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24043>)

