AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00001564> "It is one of the highest non-synthetic sources of nitrogen. It usually comes from cattle or hogs as a slaughterhouse by-product. N = 13.25%, P = 1.0%, K = 0.6%.

