# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002502> (ham food product)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002502> "Ham is pork from a leg cut that has been preserved by wet or dry curing, with or without smoking.  As a processed meat, the term \"ham\" includes both whole cuts of meat and ones that have been mechanically formed."@en)
