AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411041> "LanguaL curation note: A chemical food component is a food substance derived from a nonliving source (e.g., salt, water or synthesized compounds).

Note however that the LanguaL category includes additives which may be naturally derived, such as agar."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411041> "chemical food component"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411041> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00001714>)

