AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412091> "squash, gourd or pumpkin plant"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412091> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411006>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412091> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414460>)
