AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412628> "sweet pepper plant"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412628> "bell pepper plant"@en)
