AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03460364> "langual:H0364")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03460364> "dried or candied fruit"@en)
