# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_5204> (Basidiomycota)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_5204> "*Basidiomycota* is one of two large phyla that, together with the *Ascomycota*, constitute the subkingdom *Dikarya* (often referred to as the \"higher fungi\") within the kingdom Fungi. More specifically the *Basidiomycota* include these groups: mushrooms, puffballs, stinkhorns, bracket fungi, other polypores, jelly fungi, boletes, chanterelles, earth stars, smuts, bunts, rusts, mirror yeasts, and the human pathogenic yeast *Cryptococcus*."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_5204> <http://eol.org/pages/5664>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_5204> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B2035>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_5204> "basidiomycete fungi")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_5204> "basidiomycetes")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_5204> "Basidiomycota")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_5204> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_451864>)

