AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0025127> "A primordium appears as a protrusion and is the first distinct form of a plant organ (PO:0009008), cardinal organ part (PO:0025001), or collective plant organ structure (PO:0025007). The transition from a primordium to the plant structure it develops into is marked by the development of non-meristematic cells, although meristematic cells may be present after the transition.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0025127> "primordium")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0025127> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0009013>)

