AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0025131> "entidad anat&#243mica vegetal (Spanish, exact)")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0025131> "植物 解剖学（形態）的実体 (Japanese, exact)")
